  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Somehow our air system was compromised last night. Air from outside has found its way within the complex. We are all infected with the virus, and are living on borrowed time. The rest of the team agrees that we need to speed up research on Greg's cure.",
    "value": "昨夜通风系统莫名遭到破坏。外部空气已渗入设施内部。我们全员感染病毒，存活时间所剩无几。研究团队一致认为，必须加速研发格雷格的疗法。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Two days later, and not a one of us is any more ill. At least half of us should be dead by now, given the track record that the Shaxxral virus has. Something has impeded the capacity it has to affect our cells. Greg still can't communicate with us, but I would wager his cure has something to do with it.",
    "value": "两天过去，无人病情恶化。以沙克萨拉尔病毒的历史记录判断，此刻本应有半数人员死亡。某种因素阻碍了病毒侵袭细胞的能力。格雷格仍无法交流，但我敢断言，其疗法与此现象相关。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Whatever that fluid did to this agent, I am recommending the destruction of all remaining samples. These are too dangerous to be allowed to survive for further research. I am commencing tests on blood samples obtained from fellow staff members, as we have grown concerned that somehow Greg's experimental prion is spreading.",
    "value": "无论那液体对病原体产生了何种作用，我建议销毁所有剩余样本。此物过于危险，绝不能留存以供后续研究。我已开始对同事血液样本进行检测，我们担忧格雷格的实验性朊病毒正以某种方式扩散。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "I don't understand what is happening! Somehow our *other* facilities in entirely different sections of the galaxy are also experiencing the exact same issues. The prion...or whatever it is...is somehow spreading to populations across the vast gulf of space! How this is even possible is utterly beyond my capacity to theorize on.",
    "value": "无法理解现状！全宇宙彼端的其他设施竟同步出现完全相同的问题。朊病毒...或某种存在...正跨越浩瀚太空向同族群体传播！这已超出任何理论可解释的范畴。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "I've begun to hate. Not people here in the lab. Just...the uninfected. Specifically, I have unavoidable visions of brutally murdering them however I possibly can. It's not unlike having a 'wet dream', and when I awake I feel aroused. The others also remark on having the exact same....dreams? Visions? Either way, we're terrified.",
    "value": "我开始憎恶。非实验室内的同僚。而是...未被感染之人。具体而言，脑海中不断浮现以各种手段残杀他们的幻象。如同“春梦”般无法抑制，苏醒时竟伴随兴奋感。他人亦提及完全相同的...梦境？幻视？无论如何，恐惧已笼罩我们。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "Someone opened the main doors last night. It's out, free, and able to spread. The plus side is that the virus eradicating our people will be cured. Unfortunately, I can make no assurances on long-term implications of what this cure will do to us as a species.",
    "value": "昨夜有人打开了主门。它已逃脱，自由扩散。唯一利好是灭族病毒将被治愈。但此疗法对物种的长期影响，我无法作出任何保证。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/6",
    "raw": "My....mind. Slips. Seeing things I shouldn't. Greg. Hard to formulate thoughts in language. Gregga. Name easier. Feel connected to source virus, like hive mind. Greg. Be Greg.",
    "value": "我的...神智。崩坏。窥见不应存在之景。格雷格。难以组织语言。格雷嘎。此名更易脱口。感受到与源病毒的联系，如蜂巢意识。格雷格。成为格雷格。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/7",
    "raw": "I...Door...Greg. Gregga greg gregga.",
    "value": "我...门...格雷格。格雷嘎 格雷格 格雷格嘎。"
  }
]